{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9e8b8e4c-e3cf-879f-b3d7-b436af10eaf5",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:21:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:17:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. I got my property tax bill and it's higher than last time, and I don't really get why. Is that, like, a thing that happens?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:17:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can happen, sure. Let me pull it up. What's the address on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 188 Narragansett Avenue. Fifth Ward, so it's, you know, up past where the bank used to be, if you turn at that corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll take the address, I'll skip the bank. And the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anthony Iannuccilli. Two Ls, no, wait, it's I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I. I'm the landlord, it's a rental. I'm not living there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got you. Alright, I see the account. Your bill is up compared to the prior one, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so why? I didn't do anything to the place. No work, nothing. Did they, like, raise it because it's a rental?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, being a rental doesn't do that by itself. Usually it's one of two things. The tax rate changed, or the assessed value changed. Sometimes both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so what's the assessed, the assessment thing? Is that the same as what the house is worth? Because I thought that was a separate bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close, but not exactly. The assessment is the value the city uses for taxes. The tax is that value times the rate. So if either number moves, your bill moves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:19:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. So the rate times the, okay. And which one moved for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:19:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On my screen I can see the total, but the breakdown of the assessment is with the assessor's office. They're the ones who can tell you how the value was figured. I can transfer you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:19:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, so you guys send the bill but the other office decides the number? That's, okay. I thought it was all you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We collect it, they value it. Two different windows, same building. It's a very exciting system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, okay. Hold on, sorry, my oven's beeping. I'm preheating it for a tray of cookies, so if I trail off, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:19:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Cookies take priority. Do you want the transfer, or do you want me to just send you a fresh copy of the bill first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yeah, a copy. Can you mail a duplicate? The one I got, I think it went in the wrong pile and I don't know where it is. I only remember the number looked bigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:20:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can mail a duplicate. Same address on the bill, the Narragansett Avenue one, or a different mailing address for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same one. Is it, wait, does it go to the rental or to me? I'm not at the rental."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It shows your mailing address as the Narragansett Avenue property. If you want it going somewhere else, tell me and I'll note it for the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's fine, the tenant brings me my mail. Just send it there. Actually, no, hold on. Is that gonna be a problem? Does the tenant see what I pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:20:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a tax bill with the property on it. They'd see an envelope. If you'd rather it go to your own address, give me one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, let me do that. I'll give you my home one. It's, um, you know what, can I just call back with that? I'm not sure I have the zip right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:21:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can. Or I put the request in now to the property address and you tell me if you want it changed. Which one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, the property one for now. I'll figure it out. And the other office, the assessor, do I call them or do you transfer me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can transfer you right now. If it rings out, you'd want to call back later. Your duplicate is requested, and it should come in the mail in a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:21:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days. And that's separate from the, from the why part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. The copy is from me. The why is from them. Hold on one second and I'll send you over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:21:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. Sorry, I'm still kind of unsure which is which, but I'll ask them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:21:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Go get your cookies. Transferring now."
    }
  ],
